  "translation": "Yahwe, lukim, na was, long husat yu wokim olsem! Sapos ol meri bai kaikai frut bilong ol bodi, ol pikinini bilong susu, ol i smol olsem wanpela han? Sapos ol i kilim pris na profet long haus holi bilong Adonai?",
